--[[
        THE WASHROOM -- a custom room for DOORS' Hotel- (the Hotel before Hotel+)

            loadstring(game:HttpGet("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bonellocristian78-lab/Gradish-Mode/claude/sei-qui-con-noi-ye4k62/Washroom"))()

        Run it in room 0. Beside the door (0001) the floor opens: a railing, a sign, and a staircase going down, in the
        Hotel's own style (its wallpaper, its wood, its trim, its lamps). You walk down it: no teleport. At the bottom, a
        door of DOORS' own (a copy of your room's door: its knob, its number, its sounds) opens as you come, onto the
        Washroom: a big, gloomy, double-height room of chipped white tiles gone yellow, mould in the corners, a wet,
        shining floor with water standing on it. In the middle two long rows of washing machines back to back (some of
        them running: drums turning one way and the other, water sloshing, timers counting down); big dryers along the
        walls, steam puffing from their vents; neon tubes hanging from the ceiling, flickering and buzzing; fans turning;
        linen carts with stained sheets, heaps of clothes, spilled detergent; pipes under the ceiling dripping.

        Hiding, as in DOORS: the open dryers (along the walls and in the middle rows). "Hide": DOORS' own wardrobe
        animation and sounds, the dryer's door shuts behind you, DOORS' own camera lock and hiding vignette, and you see
        out through the perforated grille of its door. As with Hide, do not stay in too long: after a while DOORS' own
        Hide effect, then it throws you out (DOORS' force-out animation, 40 damage).

        The way on: DOORS' door at the far end (0001), its light red: the water holds it. Find the drain valve on one of
        the main pipes (one of three, a different one each time) and turn it: the water gurgles down the drains, the light
        turns green, the door opens as DOORS' do. Stairs back up, another of DOORS' doors at their top: through it you are
        back in room 0, in front of its door, and the Washroom closes behind you.

        Every now and then a dryer starts with a loud metal bang and spins, shaking. In some drums and carts: gold, a
        flashlight (F), the emergency key (it opens the door without draining). Your steps splash (DOORS' own water
        footsteps); your character plays DOORS' Interact animation when you use something. No monsters but Hide.

        Only you see it and walk in it (the server does not know it is there); your character's animations are seen by
        everyone. The gold is only on your screen. Run it again: a new one. getgenv().__Washroom() takes it away.
]]

